  "description": "Vulcan CPU-mode serving observability. LIVE infer metrics + cost-per-token (ADR-006/008). GPU util is LIVE-SYNTHETIC DCGM-shaped sample data (not real hardware).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Live vs synthetic vs placeholder (ADR-002)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**LIVE:** latency / throughput / error rate (`vulcan_infer_*`), contract `/health`, routing latency + **cost-per-token** from cost-exporter (`benchmark/results` + Bedrock pricing-reference + documented `$/GPU-hour` assumptions — ADR-008).\n\n**LIVE-SYNTHETIC (compose/CI):** GPU utilization via `DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL{data_source=\"synthetic_cpu_compose\"}` — real scrape path, sample values, **not** NVIDIA hardware.\n\n**Not in compose:** real DCGM on phase-7 GPU pools (`observability/gpu-metrics/helm`). Still no PLACEHOLDER `vulcan_gpu_utilization_ratio` series."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LIVE · Infer latency p95 (from histogram)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "vulcan-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "spanNulls": false }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (backend, le) (rate(vulcan_infer_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{backend}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LIVE · Throughput (requests/s)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "vulcan-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (backend) (rate(vulcan_infer_requests_total{status=\"ok\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{backend}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LIVE · Error rate",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "vulcan-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1 },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (backend) (rate(vulcan_infer_requests_total{status=\"error\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum by (backend) (rate(vulcan_infer_requests_total[5m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "{{backend}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "LIVE · Contract /health probe success",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "vulcan-prometheus" },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "OK", "color": "green" } } }
          ],
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "probe_success{job=\"vulcan-health\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "LIVE · Routing catalog latency p95 (benchmark/pricing files)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "vulcan-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "min": 0 },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "displayMode": "gradient", "orientation": "horizontal" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "vulcan_routing_latency_p95_ms",
          "legendFormat": "{{backend}} ({{source}})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "LIVE · Estimated cost / inference",
      "description": "Bedrock: pricing-reference 1k-in+1k-out. Self-hosted: ADR-008 (throughput × assumed tokens × $/GPU-hour).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "vulcan-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "currencyUSD", "decimals": 6 },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "displayMode": "gradient", "orientation": "horizontal" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "vulcan_estimated_cost_per_inference_usd",
          "legendFormat": "{{backend}} / {{model_id}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "LIVE · Estimated cost per token (ADR-006/008)",
      "description": "Bedrock: blend $/1k ÷ 1000. Self-hosted: ($/GPU-hour/3600) / (throughput_rps × assumed_tokens_per_request). Assumptions file is static_reference_assumption — not an invoice.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 29 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "vulcan-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "currencyUSD", "decimals": 9 },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "displayMode": "gradient", "orientation": "horizontal" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "vulcan_estimated_cost_usd_per_token",
          "legendFormat": "{{backend}} ({{instance_type}})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LIVE-SYNTHETIC · GPU utilization (DCGM-shaped; not real hardware)",
      "description": "DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL from synthetic-dcgm exporter (data_source=synthetic_cpu_compose). Real DCGM: observability/gpu-metrics/helm on phase-7 pools.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 29 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "vulcan-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "min": 0, "max": 100 },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL{data_source=\"synthetic_cpu_compose\"}",
          "legendFormat": "gpu={{gpu}} (SYNTHETIC)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
